{"seq":2,"slug":"requisition-approval-po-flow","title":"请购-审批-订单权限流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mro-indirect-procurement/catalog-eprocurement-p2p/requisition-approval-po-flow","wordCount":2046,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"请购-审批-订单权限流\">请购-审批-订单权限流</h1><p>一张请购单从员工点下「提交」到变成一张发给供应商的采购订单，中间要回答四个问题：谁有权批、批的是哪一层、预算在哪一步被冻结、以及一次请购能不能拆成多张订单。这四个问题的答案构成间接采购的<strong>权限模型</strong>，它比订单处理逻辑本身更决定系统的成败——权限设计得不对，员工要么被不必要的流程拖住，要么绕过系统，两条路都通向散单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-请购与订单的关系\">核心概念：请购与订单的关系</h2><p>在直接采购里请购常常只是内部申请，采购员收到后自行决定怎么下单，两者关系松散。在间接采购里请购与订单的关系必须被显式定义，因为它是<strong>授权链条</strong>本身：一张请购单的每一行要么在提交时已经被授权（走目录、在预算内、在免批阈值下），要么被路由给某个审批人；一旦全部行被授权，订单的生成就是机械动作，不需要再有人判断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关系类型</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一请购一订单</td>\n<td>一张请购单对应一张 PO，同一供应商</td>\n<td>目录采购、单供应商</td>\n<td>多供应商需求无法合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一请购多订单</td>\n<td>按供应商或交付地拆</td>\n<td>询价采购、跨主体</td>\n<td>部分行失败时状态复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多请购一订单</td>\n<td>多张请购并为一张 PO</td>\n<td>集中下单降运费</td>\n<td>授权来源需逐行保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>请购即订单</td>\n<td>提交时直接生成</td>\n<td>免批额度内的目录采购</td>\n<td>无二次确认机会</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第四种「请购即订单」是间接采购独有的形态，也是效率最高的形态：员工在商城提交购物车的那一刻，订单已经生成并发送。它成立的前提是前三道校验全部通过，因此它的判断条件必须严格——只要有一行不满足（超预算、非协议供应商、超免批额），整单退回常规路径。这解释了为什么校验必须在提交的同一事务里完成，而不是异步检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审批权限的建模\">审批权限的建模</h2><p>审批权限有三个正交维度：<strong>金额区间</strong>、<strong>品类归属</strong>、<strong>组织层级</strong>。把它们混在一个「审批人列表」里会导致最常见的两个毛病：品类采购员被迫审批自己不关心的品类，以及跨级审批无从表达。正确模型是把三者分开定义再取交集。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE approval_rule (&#10;  rule_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  scope_type     VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,  -- category / org / global&#10;  scope_id       VARCHAR(64),           -- 品类 ID 或 org ID&#10;  min_amount     NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  max_amount     NUMERIC(18,2),         -- NULL = 无上限&#10;  approver_role  VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,  -- manager / category_owner / controller / cfo&#10;  sequence       SMALLINT NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,  -- 同级多人时的顺序&#10;  required_count SMALLINT NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,  -- 需几人同意（会签）&#10;  skip_if_covered BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE -- 被更高层规则覆盖时跳过&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE approval_task (&#10;  task_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  req_id         BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES requisition(req_id),&#10;  rule_id        BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES approval_rule(rule_id),&#10;  approver_id    BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES principal(principal_id),&#10;  status         VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;pending&#39;, -- pending/approved/rejected/expired&#10;  delegated_from BIGINT REFERENCES principal(principal_id),&#10;  acted_at       TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  comment        TEXT&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> approval_rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_type     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- category / org / global</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 品类 ID 或 org ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  min_amount     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_amount     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NULL = 无上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  approver_role  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- manager / category_owner / controller / cfo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  sequence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 同级多人时的顺序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  required_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 需几人同意（会签）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  skip_if_covered </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TRUE </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 被更高层规则覆盖时跳过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> approval_task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  task_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  req_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> requisition(req_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> approval_rule(rule_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  approver_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> principal(principal_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- pending/approved/rejected/expired</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  delegated_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> principal(principal_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  acted_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  comment        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>skip_if_covered</code> 解决审批链冗余：如果一笔 8 万元的品类采购已经由 CFO 按金额规则批准，那么品类采购员的规则就不必再走一遍——但<strong>必须留下被跳过的记录</strong>，否则审计无法解释为什么品类负责人没有签字。这是内控要求的具体落地：COSO 框架把控制活动列为审批、授权、核对、复核、资产保护与职责分离，并要求控制的设计与运行有效性可被评估（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Committee_of_Sponsoring_Organizations_of_the_Treadway_Commission\">COSO Internal Control</a>）；「被跳过的规则」本身就是可评估性的一部分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代理人-缺席与超时\">代理人、缺席与超时</h3><p>真实组织里审批人会在休假、离职、调岗时缺席。三种处理方式各有权衡。**代理人（delegation）**由审批人自己指定，保留原责任人记录，是首选；<strong>超时自动通过</strong>在金额低于阈值时可用，但必须限制在低风险品类；<strong>超时自动升级</strong>适用于高金额单据，超时后转上级。绝对不能用的一种是「超时即视为拒绝」——它会让紧急 MRO 备件采购因审批人休假而卡死，逼出线下采购。代理人字段 <code>delegated_from</code> 所以必须保留，是为了让「谁真正批的」与「谁本来该批」都可在事后查到。</p>\n<h3 id=\"预算冻结的时点\">预算冻结的时点</h3><p>预算占用必须在<strong>提交请购时</strong>发生，而不是在订单或发票时。理由在于时间差：从请购到发票通常跨越数周，如果占用放在发票环节，那么两笔各自合规的采购可以在同一预算上叠加超额而系统毫不知情。会计上这个机制叫<strong>承诺占用（encumbrance）</strong>：请购产生的是「预计支出但尚无法律责任」的预承诺，采购订单产生的才是「未来有法律义务支出」的正式承诺，货物或服务实际收到并开票后才转为实支，同时释放承诺（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encumbrance\">Encumbrance</a>）。三段式对应到系统上就是三个状态字段，而非一个「已用预算」的计数器。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Draft&#10;  Draft --&gt; PendingApproval: 提交(校验通过)&#10;  Draft --&gt; Rejected: 校验失败(拆单/非协议供应商)&#10;  PendingApproval --&gt; Approved: 审批通过&#10;  PendingApproval --&gt; Rejected: 审批拒绝&#10;  PendingApproval --&gt; Expired: 超时(按规则升级或转代理)&#10;  Approved --&gt; Ordered: 生成PO&#10;  Ordered --&gt; Received: 收货&#10;  Received --&gt; Invoiced: 三单匹配通过&#10;  Invoiced --&gt; Closed: 付款&#10;  Rejected --&gt; Draft: 修改后重提&#10;  Approved --&gt; Cancelled: 需求取消(释放预算)\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Draft\n  Draft --&gt; PendingApproval: 提交(校验通过)\n  Draft --&gt; Rejected: 校验失败(拆单/非协议供应商)\n  PendingApproval --&gt; Approved: 审批通过\n  PendingApproval --&gt; Rejected: 审批拒绝\n  PendingApproval --&gt; Expired: 超时(按规则升级或转代理)\n  Approved --&gt; Ordered: 生成PO\n  Ordered --&gt; Received: 收货\n  Received --&gt; Invoiced: 三单匹配通过\n  Invoiced --&gt; Closed: 付款\n  Rejected --&gt; Draft: 修改后重提\n  Approved --&gt; Cancelled: 需求取消(释放预算)</pre><h3 id=\"预算调整的闭环\">预算调整的闭环</h3><p>预算不足时系统应当提供出路而不只是拒绝。三条常见出路：<strong>调入</strong>（从同期其他成本中心借额度，需要双方负责人同意）、<strong>调期</strong>（把需求推到下期）、<strong>超额审批</strong>（走更高授权层级）。三者的共同点是都产生一条可审计的调整记录。若只有拒绝一条路，员工的最优反应就是不用系统——这又回到 <a href=\"../indirect-spend-category/indirect-spend-visibility-maverick\">间接支出可视性与散单识别</a> 里的效用比较结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拆单检测与订单拆分的区别\">拆单检测与订单拆分的区别</h2><p>两者表面上都是「一张变多张」，性质完全相反，系统必须能区分。<strong>拆单</strong>是同一需求被故意切成多张以规避审批，特征是同一发起人、同一供应商、短时间窗内、品类相同、金额分布贴着阈值。<strong>订单拆分</strong>是同一请购按供应商或交付地正常拆开，特征是各订单行来自不同供应商或不同交付地址，且请购号相同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>拆单规避</th>\n<th>正常订单拆分</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>请购号</td>\n<td>多个不同请购号</td>\n<td>同一请购号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商</td>\n<td>同一供应商</td>\n<td>不同供应商或交付地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间窗</td>\n<td>短（数天）</td>\n<td>无意义（同批生成）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额形态</td>\n<td>贴着审批阈值分布</td>\n<td>随行项目自然分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理</td>\n<td>拦截并合并、要求说明</td>\n<td>正常放行、保留共同请购引用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实现上，拆单检测放在请购提交的校验里（视同请购号与供应商的滚动窗口累加），订单拆分放在订单生成里（按供应商分组），两者代码路径不重叠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"权限的粒度-字段级授权\">权限的粒度：字段级授权</h2><p>审批权限不止于「批或不批」，还包括<strong>批的时候能不能改</strong>。品类采购员通常被允许修改供应商与价格，部门经理不允许改价格只允许改数量与交付期，成本中心负责人不允许改任何采购参数只允许批预算。把这种差别建模成「审批动作携带可修改字段集」，而不是靠角色判断散落在代码里：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;approver_role&quot;: &quot;category_owner&quot;,&#10;  &quot;on_approve&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;allowed_edits&quot;: [&quot;supplier_id&quot;, &quot;unit_price&quot;, &quot;line_qty&quot;, &quot;uom&quot;],&#10;    &quot;forbidden_edits&quot;: [&quot;cost_center_id&quot;, &quot;budget_period&quot;],&#10;    &quot;escalate_if&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;total_amount&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;&gt;&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 100000, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;cfo&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;supplier_is_approved&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;==&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: false, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;compliance&quot; }&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"approver_role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category_owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"on_approve\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"allowed_edits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supplier_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unit_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"line_qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"uom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"forbidden_edits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cost_center_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"budget_period\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"escalate_if\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"total_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cfo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supplier_is_approved\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"==\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"compliance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>escalate_if</code> 让规则可配置：当采购员想在一次审批中把供应商换成非准入供应商，或总金额被改高到超出自己权限，系统自动再转一级，而不需要他手动重提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>请购到订单的核心是一张审批规则表加一个三段式预算占用模型：金额、品类、组织三个维度分别定义规则后取交集，被跳过的规则要留痕；预算在请购时占用（预承诺），订单生成时转为正式承诺，开票时转为实支；预算不足要提供调入、调期、超额审批三条出路；拆单规避与订单拆分必须用两套判断区分。这套权限与占用模型的落地细节在第四章展开，见 <a href=\"../indirect-budget-settlement/cost-center-budget-control\">成本中心/项目预算与超额审批</a>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>审批规则按金额、品类、组织三个维度分别定义后取交集，被跳过的规则要留痕</li>\n<li>预算在请购时占用（预承诺），订单生成转正式承诺，开票转实支</li>\n<li>拆单规避与正常订单拆分必须用两套判断区分，前者拦截后者放行</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"请购-审批-订单权限流","id":"请购-审批-订单权限流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：请购与订单的关系","id":"核心概念-请购与订单的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"审批权限的建模","id":"审批权限的建模"},{"level":3,"text":"代理人、缺席与超时","id":"代理人-缺席与超时"},{"level":3,"text":"预算冻结的时点","id":"预算冻结的时点"},{"level":3,"text":"预算调整的闭环","id":"预算调整的闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"拆单检测与订单拆分的区别","id":"拆单检测与订单拆分的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"权限的粒度：字段级授权","id":"权限的粒度-字段级授权"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内部采购商城与 punch-out 供应商目录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mro-indirect-procurement/catalog-eprocurement-p2p/internal-catalog-punchout-osp"},"next":{"title":"PO/收货/发票三单匹配（联074）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mro-indirect-procurement/catalog-eprocurement-p2p/po-receipt-invoice-3way-match"}}